      "text": "When our eyes meet out of the blue?",
      "girl": "yuri"
    },
    {
      "t": 90.14,
      "end": 92.44,
      "text": "(I-I'm sorry, I said too much!)",
      "girl": "yuri"
    },
    {
      "t": 92.44,
      "end": 93.46,
      "text": "I really love\u2014",
