      "end": 99.88,
      "text": "I wanna hear you say:",
      "girl": "monika"
    },
    {
      "t": 99.88,
      "end": 104.7,
      "text": "\"This love that I am feeling is true!\"",
      "girl": "monika"
    },
    {
      "t": 104.7,
      "end": 109.59,
      "text": "Tasty love, something I want more of!",
      "girl": "natsuki"
    },
    {
      "t": 109.59,
      "end": 112.47,
      "text": "Will it make the cut,",
      "girl": "yuri"
    },
    {
      "t": 112.47,
      "end": 116.14,
      "text": "If you had to choose just one of us?",
      "girl": "yuri"
    },
    {
      "t": 116.14,
      "end": 118.09,
      "text": "Shall I leave you be?",
      "girl": "monika"
    },
    {
      "t": 118.09,
      "end": 121.19,
      "text": "Is it love if I can set you free?",
      "girl": "monika"
    },
    {
      "t": 121.19,
      "end": 123.63,
      "text": "But even if it's not reality,",
      "girl": "monika"
    },
    {
      "t": 123.63,
      "end": 125.7,
      "text": "Let's be together forever,",
      "girl": "monika"
    },
    {
      "t": 125.7,
      "end": 127.67,
      "text": "We're never gonna be apart!",
      "girl": "monika"
    },
    {
      "t": 127.67,
      "end": 129.79,
      "text": "How can I convey,",
      "girl": "yuri"
    },
    {
      "t": 129.79,
      "end": 132.78,
      "text": "My love for you before they fly away?",
      "girl": "yuri"
    },
    {
      "t": 132.78,
      "end": 135.49,
      "text": "I think about it all day everyday",
